{
  "about": "The games built into Mooncart. tools/collect-games.mjs downloads each source repository, runs its build when it has one, packs anything the pages load from the internet into the pages themselves, and writes the result to build/collection/ for the app. Edit this list to change what ships inside the app. 'folder' is where the game appears in the library; 'name' overrides the game's own title; 'saveKey' picks its save slot (games with the same slot share saved progress); 'opts' sets how it plays at first (e.g. frame: false to hide the console round a game that draws its own). A source's 'paths' fetches only those files; 'build' runs that command in it first.",
